msgstr "运行结束后，命令打印吞吐量与资源摘要，完整结果保存在 JSON 输出中。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/run_benchmarks.rst:93
msgid ""
"Read ``runtime.environment_step_timing.environment_step_fps`` for the "
"aggregate environment-step rate. Runtime samples random actions before "
"starting the ``env.step()`` timer, so random-action generation is outside "
"this timing. For a runtime run, ``runtime.collection_fps`` and "
"``runtime.total_fps`` describe the same random-action stepping workload."
msgstr ""
"读取 ``runtime.environment_step_timing.environment_step_fps`` "
"，获取所有环境合计的步进速率。Runtime 在启动 ``env.step()`` 计时器前采样随机动作，因此动作生成不计入该时间。对于 runtime"
" 运行， ``runtime.collection_fps`` 和 ``runtime.total_fps`` 描述同一个随机动作步进负载。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/run_benchmarks.rst:99
msgid ""
"Render and physics scope profiling requires a non-``None`` "
"``benchmark_mode`` in the task configuration. If the field is absent or "
"``None``, both scopes remain disabled even when their profiling flags are "
"set; standard runtime reports are still produced."
msgstr ""
"渲染与物理范围的性能分析，要求任务配置中的 ``benchmark_mode`` 不为 ``None`` 。如果该字段不存在或为 ``None`` "
"，即使设置对应分析标志，两种范围仍不会启用；标准运行时报告仍会生成。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/run_benchmarks.rst:103
msgid ""
"For ``Isaac-RenderBenchmark-Franka-Cabinet``, an unset ``BENCHMARK_MODE`` "
"defaults to ``None``: physics and camera rendering still run, without "
"benchmark animation or scope profiling. Set ``BENCHMARK_MODE=render`` to "
"write analytic joint poses after physics, while "
"``BENCHMARK_MODE=physics_render`` sets actuator targets before physics. Both"
" modes still step physics. Direct posing requires "
"``scene.lazy_sensor_update=True``. With Isaac RTX, use ``--visualizer none``"
" in this mode: a Kit visualizer would render before the pose write."
msgstr ""
"对于 ``Isaac-RenderBenchmark-Franka-Cabinet`` ，未设置 ``BENCHMARK_MODE`` 时默认为 "
"``None`` ：物理与相机渲染仍运行，但没有基准动画或范围性能分析。设置 ``BENCHMARK_MODE=render`` "
"，可在物理步之后写入解析计算的关节位姿； ``BENCHMARK_MODE=physics_render`` "
"则在物理步之前设置执行器目标。两种模式仍会推进物理。直接设置位姿要求 ``scene.lazy_sensor_update=True`` 。使用 "
"Isaac RTX 时，此模式应指定 ``--visualizer none`` ，因为 Kit 可视化器会在写入位姿前渲染。"

#: source/developer-tools/benchmarking/run_benchmarks.rst:111
msgid ""
"Set ``ISAACLAB_PHYSICS_PROFILE=1`` to collect synchronized physics-step "
"timings during the runtime measurement loop. The benchmark wraps the "
"selected physics manager's ``step`` through "
":func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.stepping.profile_physics_steps` during the "
"measurement loop. Similarly, ``ISAACLAB_RENDER_PROFILE=1`` wraps registered "
"renderers through :func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.stepping.profile_renderers`, "
"timing only ``render()`` and excluding scene updates and output readback. "
"Both context managers install wrappers after warmup and restore the original"
" methods when measurement ends, including on failure, so subsequent "
"benchmark runs are unaffected. The render sweep enables both flags but "
"requires an explicit ``BENCHMARK_MODE=render`` or "
"``BENCHMARK_MODE=physics_render`` to collect timings. Ordered ``[scope, "
"elapsed_ms]`` samples are written under ``timings_ms`` in the local "
"``<output_path>/profile_timings.json`` file. The benchmark bundle's "
"``extra`` dictionary holds scalar ``physics_mean_ms``, ``physics_std_ms``, "
"``physics_max_ms``, ``physics_calls``, and corresponding ``render_*`` "
"summaries. Disabled scopes contribute no keys. Schema version 1.4 remains "
"unchanged, and OmniPerf output includes the same summaries. These statistics"
" describe individual calls after warmup; the render sweep instead groups "
"physics calls by rendered frame and discards its padding frames. The sweep "
"reads the local profiling file from a separate directory for each profile. "
"Device synchronization changes execution overlap, so these profiled runs are"
" diagnostics rather than throughput measurements."
msgstr ""
"设置 ``ISAACLAB_PHYSICS_PROFILE=1`` ，可在运行时测量循环中采集同步的物理步耗时。测试通过 "
":func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.stepping.profile_physics_steps` ，在测量期间封装所选物理管理器的 "
"``step`` 。类似地， ``ISAACLAB_RENDER_PROFILE=1`` 通过 "
":func:`~isaaclab.benchmark.stepping.profile_renderers` 封装已注册的渲染器，只测量 "
"``render()`` "
"，排除场景更新与输出读回。两个上下文管理器均在预热后安装封装，并在测量结束时恢复原方法，包括发生错误时，因此不会影响后续测试。渲染参数扫描启用两个标志，但必须显式设置"
" ``BENCHMARK_MODE=render`` 或 ``BENCHMARK_MODE=physics_render`` 才会采集耗时。按顺序记录的"
" ``[scope, elapsed_ms]`` 样本写入本地 ``<output_path>/profile_timings.json`` 的 "
"``timings_ms`` 。结果包的 ``extra`` 字典保存标量摘要 ``physics_mean_ms`` 、 "
"``physics_std_ms`` 、 ``physics_max_ms`` 、 ``physics_calls`` 和对应的 "
"``render_*`` 摘要；禁用范围不生成键。数据结构版本仍为 1.4，OmniPerf "
"输出包含相同摘要。这些统计描述预热后的单次调用；渲染扫描则按渲染帧汇总物理调用，并丢弃填充帧。扫描从每个配置各自的目录读取本地性能分析文件。设备同步会改变执行重叠，因此这些分析运行属于诊断，而非吞吐量测量。"

